        "ref": "NUM 13:29 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Amalek dwells in the land of the South. The Hittite, the Jebusite, and the Amorite dwell in the hill country. The Canaanite dwells by the sea, and along the side of the Jordan.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:25 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Since the Amalekite and the Canaanite dwell in the valley, tomorrow turn and go into the wilderness by the way to the Red Sea.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:43 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "For there the Amalekite and the Canaanite are before you, and you will fall by the sword because you turned back from following the LORD; therefore the LORD will not be with you.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:45 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then the Amalekites came down, and the Canaanites who lived in that mountain, and struck them and beat them down even to Hormah."
